{{!--
Plain-text Handlebars template for the build-time bundled-deps blob
embedded in tisvlay-gui's About → Notices pane (via build.rs writing
to $OUT_DIR/THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt; the GUI consumes it through
include_str!, splits on lines, and feeds the result into a virtualised
ListView in `notices_pane.slint`).

cargo-about output template variables (see `License`, `LicenseSet`,
and `PackageLicense` in
`docs/cargo-about/src/generate.rs:8-70`):

  overview : Vec<LicenseSet>      one entry per SPDX id, with `text`
                                  taken from the first crate that
                                  uses that license — the canonical
                                  variant. We iterate this for the
                                  license-text section.
  licenses : Vec<License>         one entry per (id, text-variation)
                                  pair; we DO NOT iterate this here
                                  because subtle text variations
                                  (different copyright headers etc.)
                                  produce visual duplicates of the
                                  same SPDX id. Use `overview` for
                                  user-facing dedup; `licenses` for
                                  legal review.
  crates   : Vec<PackageLicense>  one per crate, with `.package`
                                  (cargo metadata) and `.license`
                                  (the resolved SPDX id).

`{{{ ... }}}` (triple-stash) emits values unescaped; `{{ ... }}` would
HTML-encode quotes etc. — appropriate for the .html template, wrong
for a plain-text blob piped into Slint's TextEdit/ListView.
--}}
